  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Nestled in The Bungalows at Seagrove in Santa Rosa Beach, this charming bungalow offers guests a cozy retreat with two bedrooms. The first bedroom features a king bed, the second with a queen bed and twin trundle bed. Both of the bedrooms have a private bath, one with a bathtub and shower combo, and the other with a full shower perfect for relaxing after a day of adventure. Downstairs is a half bath with a laundry room. Guests can unwind in the soothing living room, which also includes a comfortable queen sleeper sofa bed. This property also has a full kitchen if you decide to stay in and cook for the night. All cooking utensils and appliances are ready to go. We also just added high speed fiber internet if you have to do a little work from home while on vacation. With central heating and AC, the space stays comfortable year-round. Whether you’re here to explore or simply relax, this excellent bungalow provides a welcoming home base. The Bungalows of Seagrove have 1 resort style pool just a few steps away and a small dipping pool on the property. This house was just fully renovated to current styles with new paint, floors, furniture, tile, etc. We look forward to hosting you at our place!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Beautiful 2-bedroom bungalow in enchanting Santa Rosa Beach with AC"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
